flowchart TD
    start([New run]) --> context[Resolve repository, base branch, validation, guardrails]
    context --> preflight[Check GitHub CLI auth and Jira MCP]
    preflight -->|Missing access| failed[Record an accurate stage error]
    preflight -->|Ready| ticket[Fetch ticket, acceptance criteria, branch name]
    ticket --> plan[Agent creates plan, validation approach, review focus, PR summary]

    plan --> planApproval{Plan decision}
    planApproval -->|Revise with feedback| plan
    planApproval -->|Reject| rejected([Stop: plan rejected])
    planApproval -->|Approve| branch[Create or reuse ticket branch and isolated worktree]

    branch --> implement[Agent implements in the worktree; configured validation runs]
    implement --> impact[Assess Swift blast radius]
    impact --> review[Agent reviews correctness, tests, wiring, standards]
    review --> changeApproval{Change decision}
    changeApproval -->|Revise with feedback and findings| implement
    changeApproval -->|Approve| commit[Commit with Jira key; skip if clean]
    commit --> pr[Push branch and open draft or ready PR]
    changeApproval -->|Reject: nothing published| cleanup
    pr --> cleanup[Remove clean worktree; keep branch]
    cleanup --> done([Final status report])

    stageFailure[Any agent, Git, or GitHub step failure] -.-> failed
    failed --> retry[Retry only the failed step]

    classDef action fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#3667a6,color:#152033;
    classDef decision fill:#fff4cc,stroke:#a46f00,color:#332500;
    classDef success fill:#e4f6e9,stroke:#2f7d44,color:#12351c;
    classDef stop fill:#f8e7e7,stroke:#a33d3d,color:#421919;
    class context,preflight,ticket,plan,branch,implement,impact,review,commit,pr,cleanup,failed,retry action;
    class planApproval,changeApproval decision;
    class done success;
    class rejected stop;
